#: mvc/app/views/OPNsense/PolicyAnalyzer/setup.volt:151
msgid ""
"A local runtime works, but expect slower answers and plan explanations "
"outside peak hours. A server in your LAN or an API is the comfortable option."
msgstr "Et lokalt kjøremiljø fungerer, men regn med tregere svar og planlegg forklaringer utenom de travleste timene. En server i LAN-et ditt eller et API er det komfortable valget."

#: mvc/app/views/OPNsense/PolicyAnalyzer/setup.volt:106
msgid "A setup job is running"
msgstr "En oppsettjobb kjører"

#: mvc/app/views/OPNsense/PolicyAnalyzer/setup.volt:47
msgid ""
"A setup job is running for this step; its progress is shown above and in the "
"action history."
msgstr "En oppsettjobb kjører for dette trinnet; fremdriften vises ovenfor og i handlingshistorikken."

#: mvc/app/views/OPNsense/PolicyAnalyzer/setup.volt:254
msgid ""
"A short benchmark measures the real speed (the model is loaded and the jail "
"CPUs are busy for one or two minutes). Then explain one finding to see the "
"result."
msgstr "En kort ytelsestest måler den reelle hastigheten (modellen lastes og CPU-ene i jailen er opptatt i ett eller to minutter). Forklar deretter ett funn for å se resultatet."

